{'symbol': 'PHM', 'date': '2023-02-01 17:43:00', 'title': 'PULTEGROUP ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.16 PER SHARE', 'text': 'ATLANTA--( BUSINESS WIRE )--PULTEGROUP, INC. (NYSE: PHM) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.16 PER COMMON SHARE PAYABLE APRIL 4, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 20, 2023.'}